//! **Authoritative game-data spine** — the real, shipped Blades tuning
//! numbers, generated from the extracted client data. Phase 1 of "play
//! like retail".
//!
//! # Why this module exists
//!
//! The combat model was built on guessed / UESP-derived constants that are
//! wrong by large factors (Ward duration 20x off, the paralyze threshold
//! ~43x off, damage-over-time 6.7x off *and* nonzero for Frost/Shock, which
//! in the shipped data deal **no** percent-health damage at all). Every
//! number below comes from the game's own data instead:
//!
//! | table | source | rows |
//! |---|---|---|
//! | [`combat_params`] | `CombatParameters` / `PlayerCombatParameters` / `PvpParameters` | — |
//! | [`WEAPONS`] | `WeaponTemplateList` | 370 |
//! | [`ARMORS`] | `ArmorTemplateList` | 254 |
//! | [`SHIELDS`] | `ShieldTemplateList` | 51 |
//! | [`ABILITIES`] / [`ABILITY_RANKS`] | `LearnableAbilityList` + per-rank assets | 63 / 706 |
//! | [`ENCHANT_FAMILIES`] | `ItemPropertyList` | 116 |
//!
//! # Design
//!
//! * **Pure `const` tables.** No `build.rs`, no runtime `serde`, no build-time
//!   file reads — this generated source *is* the artifact and is committed.
//! * **Leaf module.** It depends on nothing else in [`crate::arena::combat`];
//!   `damage.rs` / `state.rs` / `resolve.rs` / `loadout.rs` / `tables.rs` are
//!   free to start consuming it without any circularity.
//! * **Lookups are binary searches** over uuid-sorted slices: `O(log n)`, zero
//!   allocation, usable from a `const`-ish/no-alloc context.
//! * **Source hashes are embedded** ([`source_hashes`]). If someone re-runs an
//!   extractor and the numbers move underneath the combat model without this
//!   file being regenerated, the `tests` module fails loudly instead of the
//!   fight silently drifting away from retail.
//!
//! # Regenerating
//!
//! ```text
//! blades-capture/reference/game-defs/extract/x_abilities_full.py
//! blades-capture/reference/game-defs/extract/x_item_properties.py
//! blades-capture/reference/game-defs/extract/gen_gamedata_rs.py
//! ```
//!
//! <div class="warning">
//! DO NOT hand-edit below the generator banner — regenerate instead.
//! </div>

#![allow(dead_code)]

